  "causebase_summary": "VITAL LIFE CHOICE LTD is registered with the ACNC as a charity described on its website as a Health Promotion Charity focused on prevention and control of mental and physical diseases, with particular emphasis on Type 2 diabetes. The organisation’s website lists an Adelaide address (Henley Beach Rd, Lockleys SA 5032) and ABN 20 695 710 082. The site describes its core activity as “Community Health Centre Operation (87900 — mainly counselling)” and presents the organisation as offering community health counselling services that link mental choices, diet and environment to physical disease. The website also says the organisation disseminates evidence-based medical research and educational resources, allows open redistribution for non-commercial disease-prevention purposes, and plans quarterly public awareness campaigns focused sequentially on excess carbohydrates, salt, oil and plastic exposure using TV, radio, live events and digital media. The site states requested funds would support staff roles (Project Manager, marketing specialists) and digital resources. It notes a research partner, VitaChoice LTD, listed as located in Darwin. The website includes a medical-advice disclaimer that materials are for educational purposes and encourages volunteer involvement and partnerships.",
